{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19024","headline":"令狐相公见示题洋州崔侍郎宅双木瓜花顷接侍郎同舍陪宴树下吟翫来什辄成和章 · 刘禹锡","name":"令狐相公见示题洋州崔侍郎宅双木瓜花顷接侍郎同舍陪宴树下吟翫来什辄成和章","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"金牛蜀楼远，玉树帝城春。\n荣耀生华馆，逢迎欠主人。\n帘前疑小雪，墙外丽行尘。\n来去皆回首，情深是德邻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19024.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19024","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}